{
  "title": { "zh": "两种放大", "en": "Two enlargements" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "手上有两种缩放：最近邻和双线性。这一关的问题是：用它们放大同一张图，结果差在哪里？是不是总有一种更好？先并排放大，再把结果认到剖面上，最后判断一句论断。",
        "en": "Two resizers are in hand: nearest neighbour and bilinear. This level asks: enlarging one image with each, how do the results differ, and is one always better? Enlarge side by side, match the results to profiles, then judge a claim."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1D6",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": { "zh": "并排放大", "en": "Side by side" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "输入一张图和新的宽、高：交出最近邻和双线性各自缩放的结果。",
        "en": "Given an image and a new width and height, give the nearest-neighbour and the bilinear results."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "图", "en": "Image" } },
        { "name": "w", "label": { "zh": "新宽", "en": "New width" } },
        { "name": "h", "label": { "zh": "新高", "en": "New height" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "nn", "label": { "zh": "最近邻", "en": "Nearest" } },
        { "name": "bl", "label": { "zh": "双线性", "en": "Bilinear" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0, 1]], "w": 5, "h": 1 },
          "expect": { "nn": [[0, 0, 1, 1, 1]], "bl": [[0, 0.1, 0.5, 0.9, 1]] }
        },
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0, 0, 1, 1]], "w": 8, "h": 1 },
          "expect": { "nn": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1]], "bl": [[0, 0, 0, 0.25, 0.75, 1, 1, 1]] }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[0, 1], [1, 0]], "w": 3, "h": 3 },
          "expect": {
            "nn": [[0, 1, 1], [1, 0, 0], [1, 0, 0]],
            "bl": [[0, 0.5, 1], [0.5, 0.5, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0]]
          }
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["n = resizeNearest(image, w, h)", "l = resizeLinear(image, w, h)", "nn <- n", "bl <- l"]
    },
    {
      "id": "1D6_2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "step": { "zh": "认剖面", "en": "Profiles" },
      "brief": { "zh": "为两种放大的结果各选出它的剖面。", "en": "For each of the two enlargements, choose its profile." },
      "judge": "match",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "[0, 1] 用最近邻放大到 5 像素",
                "en": "[0, 1] enlarged to 5 pixels by nearest neighbour"
              },
              "is": "nearest"
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "[0, 1] 用双线性放大到 5 像素", "en": "[0, 1] enlarged to 5 pixels by bilinear" },
              "is": "bilinear"
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": { "zh": "剖面 1", "en": "Profile 1" },
              "image": [[0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1]],
              "is": "corners"
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": { "zh": "剖面 2", "en": "Profile 2" },
              "image": [[0, 0.1, 0.5, 0.9, 1]],
              "is": "bilinear"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": { "zh": "剖面 3", "en": "Profile 3" },
              "image": [[0, 0, 1, 1, 1]],
              "is": "nearest"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "[0, 0, 1, 1] 用双线性放大到 8 像素",
                "en": "[0, 0, 1, 1] enlarged to 8 pixels by bilinear"
              },
              "is": "bilinear"
            },
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "[0, 0, 1, 1] 用最近邻放大到 8 像素",
                "en": "[0, 0, 1, 1] enlarged to 8 pixels by nearest neighbour"
              },
              "is": "nearest"
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": { "zh": "剖面 1", "en": "Profile 1" },
              "image": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1, 1]],
              "is": "nearest"
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": { "zh": "剖面 2", "en": "Profile 2" },
              "image": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 1]],
              "is": "shifted"
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": { "zh": "剖面 3", "en": "Profile 3" },
              "image": [[0, 0, 0, 0.25, 0.75, 1, 1, 1]],
              "is": "bilinear"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1D6_3",
      "kind": "choice",
      "step": { "zh": "一个反例", "en": "A counterexample" },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "选出说明「双线性总比最近邻好」不成立的那组结果。",
        "en": "Choose the result that shows 'bilinear is always better than nearest neighbour' does not hold."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "有的图里，每个值都有固定的含义，两者之间的值没有意义。",
          "en": "In some images every value has a fixed meaning, and values in between mean nothing."
        }
      ],
      "judge": "answer",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            { "prompt": { "zh": "哪一组结果是反例？", "en": "Which result is a counterexample?" }, "answer": ["b"] }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": {
                "zh": "天空的亮度渐变 [0.2, 0.4]，双线性放大：[0.2, 0.25, 0.35, 0.4]",
                "en": "a sky's brightness ramp [0.2, 0.4], bilinear: [0.2, 0.25, 0.35, 0.4]"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": {
                "zh": "分割标签图（0 背景，1 物体）[0, 1]，双线性放大：[0, 0.25, 0.75, 1]",
                "en": "a segmentation label map (0 background, 1 object) [0, 1], bilinear: [0, 0.25, 0.75, 1]"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": {
                "zh": "一张照片的灰度 [0.6, 0.8]，双线性放大：[0.6, 0.65, 0.75, 0.8]",
                "en": "a photo's grey levels [0.6, 0.8], bilinear: [0.6, 0.65, 0.75, 0.8]"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "这一批里，哪一组结果是反例？", "en": "In this batch, which result is a counterexample?" },
              "answer": ["c"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": {
                "zh": "温度图 [10, 30]，双线性放大：[10, 15, 25, 30]",
                "en": "a temperature map [10, 30], bilinear: [10, 15, 25, 30]"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": {
                "zh": "深度图 [2, 4]，双线性放大：[2, 2.5, 3.5, 4]",
                "en": "a depth map [2, 4], bilinear: [2, 2.5, 3.5, 4]"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": {
                "zh": "类别编号图（1 道路，3 行人）[1, 3]，双线性放大：[1, 1.5, 2.5, 3]",
                "en": "a class id map (1 road, 3 pedestrian) [1, 3], bilinear: [1, 1.5, 2.5, 3]"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
